{"id":"word:hebrew:H2568","type":"word","title":"חָמֵשׁ","subtitle":"H2568 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"five","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to חָמֵשׁ (H2568) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 345 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"חָמֵשׁ (châmêsh) means five First listed occurrence: 1Chr 2 4."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"חָמֵשׁ","transliteration":"châmêsh","pronunciation":"khaw-maysh'","strong":"H2568","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2568","partOfSpeech":"n","forms":["וַ/חֲמֵ֥שׁ","חָמֵ֥שׁ","חֲמִשָּׁה֙","וְ/חָמֵ֤שׁ","חֲמֵ֥שׁ"],"morphs":[["HAcfsa",96],["HAcmsa",91],["HC/Acfsa",68],["HC/Acmsa",38],["HAcmsc",22],["HR/Acmsa",18],["HR/Acmsc",3],["HC/Acmsc",3],["HC/R/Acfsa",3],["HR/Acfsa",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"five","usage":"fif(-teen), fifth, five (× apiece).","full":"H2568. chamesh or chamishshah חֲמִשָּׁה חָמֵשׁ, 342 noun masculine and feminine five (Late Hebrew id.; id. ; Aramaic חַמְשָׁא חֲמֵשׁ, , , ; Phoenician חמשת ; Palmyrene חמשא , with masculine noun, Reckend ZMG 1888, 408 ; Assyrian —amšu, —amiltu Dl § 75 ; Ethiopic Arabic , Sabean & Lihyânian חֿמס DHM ZMG xxix, 613 ; Epigr. Denkm. 71, 73); — masculine (c. noun feminine ) absolute חָמֵשׁ Gen 5:6 94t. + Ezek 40:30 (strike out ᵐ5 B Hi-Sm Co; Co strike out also in 40:25 ; 40:29 ; 40:33 ; 40:36 ) + 45:3 Kt (where read feminine with Qr); construct חֲמֵשׁ Gen 5:10 67t. + Ezek 48:16 Kt; feminine (c. noun masculine ) absolute חֲמִשָּׁה see Lag BN 80 Gen 18:28 139t. (including Ezek 8:16 strike out B Co and others); construct חֲמֵשֶׁת Num 3:47 (twice in verse) + 26 t.; — on plural חֲמִשִּׁים fifty , see below; — five , in Hexateuch chiefly P; — 1 without other numeral : a. חָמֵשׁ before feminine plural noun Gen 43:34 35t.; before collective noun ׳ח צאֹן 1Sam 25:18 ; see also ׳ח בָּאַמָּה five in cubit ( s ) = five cubits 1Kin 7:23 ; 1Chr 11:23 ; 2Chr 4:2 ; after noun (late) 2Kin 8:16 ( לְיוֺרָם חָמֵשׁ בִּשְׁנַת = in the fifth year ) + 6 t. Chronicles; no noun expressed 1Kin 7:39 (twice in verse); 7:49 (twice in verse); 1Chr 3:20 ; 2Chr 4:7 (twice in verse). b. חֲמִשָּׁה before masculine plural noun Gen 47:2 18 t.; after noun Exod 36:38 36 t. Numbers (all P); no noun expressed Gen 14:9 (only here with article) + 20 t. c. חֲמֵשׁ before noun (usually defined; except אֲלָפִים מֵאוֺת, , see 3, 4 ) Exod 26:3 , 9 ; 36:10 , 16 + Ezek 42:16 ׳ח אַמּוֺת Kt, but Qr ׳ח מאות , see below d. חַמְּלָכִים חֲמֵשֶׁת Josh 10:5 5 t.; ׳ח הָאֲנָשִׁים Judg 18:7 , 14 , 17 ; ׳ח שׁקלים Num 18:16 ; also, distributive, ׳ח ׳ח שְׁקָלִים 3:47 ; ׳ח הַסְּרָנִים Josh 13:3 ; Judg 3:3 ; 1Sam 6:18 ; ׳ח מ ׳בני 2Sam 21:8 . e. = ordinal, ליורם חָמֵשׁ בִּשְׁנַת 2Kin 8:16 the fifth (year) of Joram ; לַחֹדֶשׁ בַּחֲמִשָּׁה on the fifth (day) of the month Ezek 1:1-2 , 8:1 ; 33:21 ; (so also 15th, 25th, etc.) 2 ׳ח combined with עשׂרה עשׂר, ten = fifteen: a. עֶשְׂרֵה חֲמֵשׁ (c. noun feminine ) Gen 5:10 ; 7:20 ; Exod 27:14-15 , 38:14-15 , 2Kin 14:17 , 23 ; 20:6 ; 2Chr 15:10 ; 25:25 ; Isa 38:5 . b. עָשָׂר חֲמִשָּׁה (c. noun masculine ), (1) after noun Est 9:21 ; (2) before noun Exod 16:1 ( = ordinal fifteenth , so Lev 23:6 +) Hosea 3:2 +. c. עָשָׂר חֲמֵשֶׁת before noun 2Sam 19:18 +. d. עָשָׂר חֲמֵשֶׁת , without noun = ordinal fifteenth 1Chr 24:14 4 t. + Ezek 45:12 (read חֲמִשִּׁים A Hi Co). 3 מֵאוֺת חֲמֵשׁ = 500 Gen 5:30 , 32 49t. + Ezek 42:16 Qr. 4 אֲלָפִים חֲמֵשֶׁת = 5000 Num 31:32 ; Josh 8:12 ; Judg 20:45 ; 1Sam 17:5 ; Ezek 45:6 ; 48:15 ; 1Chr 29:7 ; 2Chr 35:9 ; Ezra 1:11 ; 2:69 ; &#8212; in 25, 000, 35, 000 etc. חֲמִשָּׁה (usually without ׳א ) precedes the 20, 000, 30, 000, etc. 5 with other numerals : a. חָמֵשׁ before larger numeral: (1) noun repeated Gen 5:6 4 t.; (2) noun with 2nd number only, 5:17 8 t. + Ezek 45:3 Kt; (3) noun with בְּ with 2nd number 40:21 2 t. b. חָמֵשׁ after larger number: (1) noun repeated Gen 25:7 ; (2) noun following ׳ח (only) Judg 14:10 + (especially in expressions of age and duration); (3) noun before both numbers, stative absolute, 2Chr 3:15 ; stative construct 15:19 . c. no noun expressed, ׳ח between other number, e.g. ח מאות ׳שֵׁשׁ ושׁבעים Num 31:37 . d. חֲמִשָּׁה before larger number, noun following larger number Num 1:25 22 t. e. ׳ח follows, and (1) is followed by noun Judg 20:35 7 t.; (2) noun precedes both 1Kin 7:3 ; Jer 52:30 . f. ׳ח precedes, no noun expressed 1Kin 5:12 . g. ׳ח follows, no noun expr Gen 18:28 +. h. no noun expressed ׳ח between other number Exod 38:28 ; Ezra 2:5 .","rootNote":"masculine חֲמִשָּׁה ; a primitive numeral;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 2 4","keyReferences":["1Chr 2 4","1Chr 2 6","1Chr 3 20","1Chr 4 32","1Chr 4 42","1Chr 7 3","1Chr 7 7","1Chr 11 23"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":345,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 2 4","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמִשָּֽׁה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 2 6","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמִשָּֽׁה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 3 20","book":"1Chr","chapter":3,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חָמֵֽשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcfsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 4 32","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":32,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חָמֵֽשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcfsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 4 42","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":42,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמֵ֣שׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcfsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 7 3","book":"1Chr","chapter":7,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמִשָּׁ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 7 7","book":"1Chr","chapter":7,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמִשָּׁ֗ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 11 23","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חָמֵ֣שׁ","source":"hebrew","m